<title>SINGAPORE: Showpla buys rest of subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Showpla buys rest of subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Showpla Asia Ltd said on Friday it was buying the rest of its 65-percent owned subsidiary, Sanyo Showpla Manufacturing Pte Ltd, for a total of Singapore $2.54 million in cash.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the purchase, Sanyo Showpla will be the group's manufacturing arm in Singapore and will be renamed Qian Hui Manufacturing (S) Pte Ltd, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
